      "summary": "Bright quick-pickled English cucumber with rice vinegar, sugar and dill.",
      "method_md": "### 🥕 INGREDIENTS\n**Pickled Cucumber**\n- 1 English cucumber, thinly sliced\n- ½ tsp **fine sea salt**\n- 3 tbsp rice vinegar\n- 1½ tbsp sugar\n- 2 tbsp chopped dill\n---\n### 🔥 METHOD\n**Cucumber**\n1. Massage cucumber with salt 10 min.\n2. Drain, then toss with vinegar, sugar, dill. Chill 15 min.",
